<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of October 29 in the 1996/97 (July-June) campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On October 31, the EU additionally granted exports of 233,700 tonnes of soft wheat, 1,000 tonnes of barley, and 14,716 tonnes of rye.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 29Oct96     1Jul95 to 29Oct95</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  2,464	71     336    3,453	  780</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    1,803	85	 5    2,122	   10</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		236     118	 0	200	    0</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   28	33	 0	 84	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	185	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	    9		   0	 43	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT    4,540	75     341    6,087	  790</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   41		 139	  1	  514</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	    84     323	 0	 26	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   0	 41	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     126     185     139	 68	  514</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	     4,666	76     480    6,155	1,304</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     1,994     225	16	885	   66</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     1,483	78	 0    1,907	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  3,477     125	16    2,792	   66</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	   25    1250     176	  2	  996</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	 11	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE		25     192     176	 13	  996</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    464	53	 3	883	    7</p>
<p>  Rye flour (5)	    0		   0	  0	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (5)	    0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL RYE		 464	53	 3	883	    7</p>
<p> OATS			183		   1	  0	    0</p>
<p>  Sorghum (grain)	  0		   2	  0	  133</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL SORGHUM	     0		   2	  0	  133</p>
<p>OTHER GRAINS</p>
<p>Buckwheat, Millet,</p>
<p>   Triticale		 1		  82	  1	   37</p>
<p> TOTAL GRAIN	   8,816	90     760    9,844	2,543</p>
<p>Notes: (1) column shows this year's exports as a percentage of last year's exports, not as a percentage change (2) wheat equivalent (3) durum equivalent (4) barley equivalent (5) rye equivalent.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
